#: 324716c3988844088e6441fa4060214f of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:1
msgid "Adds an execution to backtest."
msgstr "添加一个要回测的执行函数。"

#: 748ebe767ec84c3f99f3410daca087c4 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:3
msgid ""
"A :class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval` passed to ``intervals`` "
"is one of the following:"
msgstr "传递给 ``intervals`` 的 :class:`~pybroker.interval.TimeframeInterval` 为以下之一："

#: eea423f18f324f14bc5c4742e8831b5a of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:6
msgid ""
"**Every-n-bars** (``int``): Compress every ``n`` base bars into one bar, "
"where ``n > 1``. On 1-minute data, ``5`` yields 5-bar bins (approximately"
" 5-minute bars)."
msgstr ""
"**每 n 根 K 线** （``int``）：将每 ``n`` 根基础 K 线压缩为一根 K 线，其中 ``n > 1``。在 1 分钟数据上，"
" ``5`` 会生成 5 根 K 线一组的分箱（约为 5 分钟 K 线）。"

#: bec5664f4a2041f7ae2495447760c085 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:10
msgid ""
"**Duration** (``str``): Fixed time span as digits plus one unit letter — "
"``\"1m\"``, ``\"5m\"``, ``\"1h\"``, ``\"30s\"``, or ``\"1d\"``."
msgstr ""
"**时长** （``str``）：以数字加单个单位字母表示的固定时间跨度 —— ``\"1m\"``、 ``\"5m\"``、 "
"``\"1h\"``、 ``\"30s\"`` 或 ``\"1d\"``。"

#: e9cd59625d0f41e595fff4fc20b3e570 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:13
msgid ""
"**Calendar** (``str``): Calendar buckets — ``\"daily\"``, ``\"weekly\"``,"
" ``\"monthly\"``, ``\"quarterly\"``, or ``\"yearly\"``. Weeks start on "
"Monday, months on the first of the month, quarters in January, April, "
"July, and October, and years on January 1."
msgstr ""
"**日历** （``str``）：日历分桶 —— ``\"daily\"``、 ``\"weekly\"``、 ``\"monthly\"``、 "
"``\"quarterly\"`` 或 ``\"yearly\"``。周从周一开始，月从每月 1 日开始，季度从 1、4、7、10 月开始，年从 "
"1 月 1 日开始。"

#: 4f8e9a87a8404d699a8ed435a04893bd of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:18
msgid ""
"For example, to read 5-bar bins and 1-hour duration bars on a 1-minute "
"feed, and additionally compute ``sma`` on weekly bars::"
msgstr "例如，要在 1 分钟数据源上读取 5 根 K 线分箱和 1 小时时长 K 线，并额外在周线 K 线上计算 ``sma``::"

#: a3804eeeeabd477388c4a6d8202c891a of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:29
msgid ""
":class:`Callable` invoked on every bar of data during the backtest and "
"passed an :class:`pybroker.context.ExecContext` for each ticker symbol in"
" ``symbols``."
msgstr ""
"在回测期间的每根数据 K 线上被调用，并为 ``symbols`` 中的每个股票代码传入一个 "
":class:`pybroker.context.ExecContext` 的 :class:`Callable`。"

#: 29ff3bc8ef7b49a39b60263438853ed7 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:32
msgid ""
"Ticker symbols used to run ``fn``, where ``fn`` is called separately for "
"each symbol. Can also be a :class:`pybroker.common.SymbolSelector` — a "
":class:`Callable` ``(df) -> Sequence[str]`` that picks the symbols to "
"trade once per walkforward window, so the universe changes over the "
"backtest. It receives the window's **training** data, never test data, "
"and therefore requires a training window: :meth:`.backtest` and "
"``train_size=0`` raise ``ValueError``. The candidate universe must be "
"supplied as a :class:`pandas.DataFrame` rather than a "
":class:`pybroker.data.DataSource`, since the symbols to query are unknown"
" until a window is split. A position in a symbol that a later window "
"drops is closed at the first bar of that window; if the symbol has no "
"bars left, it is closed at its final bar. Note that ``shuffle=True`` "
"randomizes the training frame's row order, so avoid it with a selector "
"that depends on bar order."
msgstr ""
"用于运行 ``fn`` 的股票代码， ``fn`` 会为每个品种单独调用。也可以是 "
":class:`pybroker.common.SymbolSelector` —— 一个 ``(df) -> Sequence[str]`` "
"形式的 :class:`Callable`，为每个向前分析窗口选择一次要交易的品种，因此品种池会在回测过程中变化。它接收该窗口的 **训练** "
"数据，绝不会接收测试数据，因此需要一个训练窗口：:meth:`.backtest` 与 ``train_size=0`` 会引发 "
"``ValueError``。候选品种池必须以 :class:`pandas.DataFrame` 形式提供，而非 "
":class:`pybroker.data.DataSource`，因为在窗口划分之前，待查询的品种是未知的。某个品种在后续窗口中被丢弃时，其仓位会在该窗口的第一根"
" K 线上平仓；如果该品种已没有剩余 K 线，则会在其最后一根 K 线上平仓。请注意， ``shuffle=True`` "
"会打乱训练数据帧的行顺序，因此应避免将其与依赖 K 线顺序的选择器搭配使用。"

#: de97270a055548899aed21578cea395f of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:48
msgid ""
":class:`Iterable` of :class:`pybroker.model.ModelSource`\\ s to "
"train/load for backtesting. A model passed directly is trained on the "
"base timeframe. Bind a model to compression intervals with "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` to instead train it on "
"exactly the listed intervals' compressed bars, together with the "
"indicators registered on it; include the literal ``'base'`` in the "
"binding to also train on the base timeframe. Per-interval predictions are"
" read with :meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds`. An interval-"
"bound model honors the ``lookahead`` passed to :meth:`.backtest`, "
":meth:`.walkforward`, or :meth:`.optimize` in the interval's units: "
"``lookahead`` compressed bars are held out between its train and test "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"要为回测训练/加载的 :class:`pybroker.model.ModelSource`\\ 的 "
":class:`Iterable`。直接传入的模型会在基础时间框架上训练。使用 "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` 将模型绑定到压缩区间后，该模型会改为在所列区间的压缩 K"
" 线上训练，连同注册给它的指标一起；在绑定中包含字面量 ``'base'`` 即可同时在基础时间框架上训练。逐区间的预测结果通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.preds` 读取。绑定到某个区间的模型会以该区间的单位遵循传递给"
" :meth:`.backtest`、:meth:`.walkforward` 或 :meth:`.optimize` 的 "
"``lookahead``：其训练行和测试行之间会保留 ``lookahead`` 根压缩 K 线。"

#: 974b56a836b24dd0aeedea27fb56fd07 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:61
msgid ""
":class:`Iterable` of :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator`\\ s to compute"
" for backtesting. An indicator passed directly is computed on the base "
"timeframe. Bind an indicator to compression intervals with "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals` to instead compute it on "
"exactly the listed intervals' compressed bars, read with "
":meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.indicator`; include the literal "
"``'base'`` in the binding to also compute it on the base timeframe."
msgstr ""
"要为回测计算的 :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator`\\ 的 "
":class:`Iterable`。直接传入的指标会在基础时间框架上计算。使用 "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals` 将指标绑定到压缩区间后，该指标会改为在所列区间的压缩"
" K 线上计算，通过 :meth:`pybroker.context.IntervalContext.indicator` "
"读取；在绑定中包含字面量 ``'base'`` 即可同时在基础时间框架上计算。"

#: 375ee7a9a71c418d8e3369810d605b40 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:71
msgid ""
":class:`Iterable` of :class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`\\ s that "
"``fn`` can read with :meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.hyperparam`."
msgstr ""
"``fn`` 可通过 :meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.hyperparam` 读取的 "
":class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`\\ 的 :class:`Iterable`。"

#: 8485ddbf08ee4f0786d086df0d1d42d6 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:74
msgid ""
"One or more compression intervals whose bars are made available to ``fn``"
" through :meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval`. Declaring an "
"interval here provides compressed bars only. It does *not* compute "
"indicators or train models on that interval. Bind those per source with "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals` and "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` instead; bound intervals are"
" automatically made available through "
":meth:`~pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval` without repeating them "
"here. Each interval must be strictly coarser than the base bar spacing "
"passed as ``timeframe`` to :meth:`.backtest` or :meth:`.walkforward`; "
"invalid combinations raise ``ValueError`` when the backtest runs. "
"Intervals are scoped to this execution, so another execution's "
":class:`pybroker.context.ExecContext` cannot read them — including inside"
" a :meth:`.set_before_exec` or :meth:`.set_after_exec` callback, which "
"receives contexts from every execution."
msgstr ""
"一个或多个压缩区间，其 K 线会通过 :meth:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval` 提供给 "
"``fn``。在此处声明一个区间仅提供压缩 K 线，*不会* 在该区间上计算指标或训练模型。请改为通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator.intervals` 和 "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` 按来源分别绑定；已绑定的区间会自动通过 "
":meth:`~pybroker.context.ExecContext.interval` "
"提供，无需在此处重复声明。每个区间都必须严格粗于传递给 :meth:`.backtest` 或 :meth:`.walkforward` 的 "
"``timeframe`` 所指定的基础 K 线间隔；无效的组合会在回测运行时引发 "
"``ValueError``。区间的作用域限定在本执行函数内，因此另一个执行函数的 "
":class:`pybroker.context.ExecContext` 无法读取它们 —— 即使在 "
":meth:`.set_before_exec` 或 :meth:`.set_after_exec` "
"回调中也是如此，尽管该回调会接收所有执行函数的上下文。"

#: 61ed020abe174a6f90abaf6fadc934bc of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:93
msgid "Positional arguments passed to ``fn``."
msgstr "传递给 ``fn`` 的位置参数。"

#: 0917d6da10494df987fa7306aa28c85b of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.add_execution:94
msgid "Keyword arguments passed to ``fn``."
msgstr "传递给 ``fn`` 的关键字参数。"

#: 75fb94c039db43cb82beb9d58c7b65db of pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:1
msgid ""
"Backtests the trading strategy by running executions that were added with"
" :meth:`.add_execution`."
msgstr "通过运行使用 :meth:`.add_execution` 添加的执行函数，对交易策略进行回测。"

#: 2c056cf3b4474f14864cabc7e757d417 of pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:4
msgid ""
"Starting date of the backtest (inclusive). Must be within ``start_date`` "
"and ``end_date`` range that was passed to :class:`.Strategy`."
msgstr "回测的起始日期（含）。必须在传递给 :class:`.Strategy` 的 ``start_date`` 和 ``end_date`` 范围之内。"

#: 06a5360fab2040e9a1eedc5d6fd4d1c8 of pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:7
msgid ""
"Ending date of the backtest (inclusive). Must be within ``start_date`` "
"and ``end_date`` range that was passed to :class:`.Strategy`."
msgstr "回测的结束日期（含）。必须在传递给 :class:`.Strategy` 的 ``start_date`` 和 ``end_date`` 范围之内。"

#: 008d2098052c48d892454ae180e9ba89 4f14c50fa2c140099353f997c7ec22c6 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:10
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:16
msgid ""
"Formatted string that specifies the timeframe resolution of the "
"backtesting data. The timeframe string supports the following units:  - "
"``\"s\"``/``\"sec\"``: seconds - ``\"m\"``/``\"min\"``: minutes - "
"``\"h\"``/``\"hour\"``: hours - ``\"d\"``/``\"day\"``: days - "
"``\"w\"``/``\"week\"``: weeks  An example timeframe string is ``1h 30m``."
" Required when any execution declares ``intervals``, since it defines the"
" base bar spacing that compression intervals are validated and aligned "
"against."
msgstr ""
"指定回测数据时间框架分辨率的格式化字符串。该时间框架字符串支持以下单位：  - ``\"s\"``/``\"sec\"``：秒 - "
"``\"m\"``/``\"min\"``：分钟 - ``\"h\"``/``\"hour\"``：小时 - "
"``\"d\"``/``\"day\"``：天 - ``\"w\"``/``\"week\"``：周  时间框架字符串示例： ``1h "
"30m``。当任何执行函数声明了 ``intervals`` 时为必需，因为它定义了压缩区间据以验证和对齐的基础 K 线间隔。"

#: 32c3c3e209fb42bd97602ccf627f363b 5b56f74c2c13418f8c2930bfcb830f0a of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:10
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:16
msgid ""
"Formatted string that specifies the timeframe resolution of the "
"backtesting data. The timeframe string supports the following units:"
msgstr "指定回测数据时间框架分辨率的格式化字符串。该时间框架字符串支持以下单位："

#: 187148abd54c4cf180c49305d547b7d7 20fb795953774e03aaa16b97bd6deac4 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:14
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:20
msgid "``\"s\"``/``\"sec\"``: seconds"
msgstr "``\"s\"``/``\"sec\"``：秒"

#: 44e68d15c3f74e90b4deacb90b663d74 969da8003bd44990b4a5f5d38f47fe6e of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:15
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:21
msgid "``\"m\"``/``\"min\"``: minutes"
msgstr "``\"m\"``/``\"min\"``：分钟"

#: a63b6655f122422ba3b16a035e763aca f344e7f4523b4515955cf36e8aa7da29 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:16
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:22
msgid "``\"h\"``/``\"hour\"``: hours"
msgstr "``\"h\"``/``\"hour\"``：小时"

#: 74d2a85c9ef64e27901a3a360739f293 f522ec12b64342508bc08285e098fde5 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:17
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:23
msgid "``\"d\"``/``\"day\"``: days"
msgstr "``\"d\"``/``\"day\"``：天"

#: 1c482373474d45db9a49f392a041596a 860a1b93da7946bdbf2dda6c8867db9c of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:18
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:24
msgid "``\"w\"``/``\"week\"``: weeks"
msgstr "``\"w\"``/``\"week\"``：周"

#: bf7039e77e214280a9f594683239a5a1 fa75f5191ecc4c4aaf76b91fe6e97907 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:20
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:26
msgid ""
"An example timeframe string is ``1h 30m``. Required when any execution "
"declares ``intervals``, since it defines the base bar spacing that "
"compression intervals are validated and aligned against."
msgstr ""
"时间框架字符串示例： ``1h 30m``。当任何执行函数声明了 ``intervals`` 时为必需，因为它定义了压缩区间据以验证和对齐的基础 "
"K 线间隔。"

#: 9600575fe26544ecb7d898897c8bb671 c5aa9a20eec04e80b386bad252ea9a28 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:24
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:30
msgid ""
"``tuple[str, str]`` of times of day e.g. ('9:30', '16:00') used to filter"
" the backtesting data (inclusive)."
msgstr "用于过滤回测数据的时间段（含边界），为 ``tuple[str, str]``，例如 ('9:30', '16:00')。"

#: 1e7ed91496b24726b58f7ddaf861421a a06299379c6d430c8fe484cc521ec24e of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:27
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:33
msgid ""
"Days (e.g. ``\"mon\"``, ``\"tues\"`` etc.) used to filter the backtesting"
" data."
msgstr "用于过滤回测数据的星期（例如 ``\"mon\"``、 ``\"tues\"`` 等）。"

#: 6fcbc86ce35f4305aea5b7cc2d8278a4 994a1dcc9ff74d8595231cf4f0ab9aa4
#: cc603898c3d446d3aec9bf5a4a65fb51 of pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:29
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:35
#: pybroker.strategy.WalkforwardMixin.walkforward_split:9
msgid ""
"Number of bars in the future of the target prediction. For example, "
"predicting returns for the next bar would have a ``lookahead`` of ``1``. "
"This quantity is needed to prevent training data from leaking into the "
"test boundary. It is expressed in the bars of the timeframe each model is"
" fitted on: a model bound to an interval with "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` holds out ``lookahead`` bars"
" of that interval, not of the base timeframe. No bar in a window's test "
"set is ever used to fit that window's models."
msgstr ""
"预测目标未来的 K 线数量。例如，预测下一根 K 线的收益率对应的 ``lookahead`` 为 "
"``1``。需要这个量来防止训练数据泄漏到测试边界。它以每个模型所拟合的时间框架的 K 线为单位：通过 "
":meth:`pybroker.model.ModelSource.intervals` 绑定到某个区间的模型，会保留该区间的 "
"``lookahead`` 根 K 线，而不是基础时间框架的 K 线。某个窗口测试集中的任何 K 线都绝不会被用于拟合该窗口的模型。"

#: 52ba4361db2d42a7ac75f4e942a072f1 c7316d3df1dc4c6bb4835fdf61f73198 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:39
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:45
msgid ""
"Amount of :class:`pybroker.data.DataSource` data to use for training, "
"where the max ``train_size`` is ``1``. For example, a ``train_size`` of "
"``0.9`` would result in 90% of data being used for training and the "
"remaining 10% of data being used for testing."
msgstr ""
"用于训练的 :class:`pybroker.data.DataSource` 数据量，其中 ``train_size`` 的最大值为 "
"``1``。例如， ``train_size`` 为 ``0.9`` 表示 90% 的数据用于训练，剩余 10% 的数据用于测试。"

#: 7b4ceb3ab22b44fb9be00a0de3b39daf ff201f01960c4c9f807ccb3647af8f13 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:44
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:50
msgid ""
"Whether to randomly shuffle the data used for training. Defaults to "
"``False``. Disabled when model caching is enabled via "
":meth:`pybroker.cache.enable_model_cache`."
msgstr ""
"是否随机打乱用于训练的数据。默认为 ``False``。当通过 :meth:`pybroker.cache.enable_model_cache`"
" 启用模型缓存时，该选项会被禁用。"

#: 96aa18c4be244daf9b3264a0fbb003be c3cd380ffa6c4fab9db0710a00ee6b5c of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:47
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:53
msgid ""
"Whether to compute randomized bootstrap evaluation metrics. Defaults to "
"``False``."
msgstr "是否计算随机自助法评估指标。默认为 ``False``。"

#: 34834041eba246c09d7c952022bcb844 50082363797549ccb094487eafc1492a of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:49
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:55
msgid ""
"If ``True``, :class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator` data is computed in "
"parallel using multiple processes. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，:class:`pybroker.indicator.Indicator` 数据会使用多个进程并行计算。默认为 "
"``False``。"

#: 3e52737bc1d347a2874137d1148d4b58 bebd6d2933ee4e61aea06e1f0250c631 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:52
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:58
msgid ""
"If ``True``, :class:`pybroker.model.ModelTrainer` models are trained in "
"parallel using multiple processes. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
"如果为 ``True``，:class:`pybroker.model.ModelTrainer` 模型会使用多个进程并行训练。默认为 "
"``False``。"

#: 2827a64168154940acd96ba027097501 c52f169b6e8843b58a3fa5715ce31839 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:57
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:63
msgid "Custom :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio` to use for backtests."
msgstr "用于回测的自定义 :class:`pybroker.portfolio.Portfolio`。"

#: 2c8466841dbf4b52a976b06fdba5e6c8 c1ffce2eabb24fe4bfb58fe1b628b91a of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:59
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:65
msgid "The type of adjustment to make to the :class:`pybroker.data.DataSource`."
msgstr "对 :class:`pybroker.data.DataSource` 应用的复权调整类型。"

#: d5ac506e8b23427699c0bad031aaf264 f26b40a378aa40a49ba5d1710ff21249 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:61
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:67
msgid "Random seed used for reproducibility. Defaults to ``42``."
msgstr "用于结果可复现的随机种子。默认为 ``42``。"

#: 41a1943f33ef408c86072124e1914ac4 4a781d453f824be1ae18b4b7e565b3ad of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.backtest:63
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:69
msgid ""
":class:`.TestResult` containing portfolio balances, order history, and "
"evaluation metrics."
msgstr "包含投资组合余额、订单历史和评估指标的 :class:`.TestResult`。"

#: 4f34d0fc736c4ce69e2d6c7e61f9ad7e of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.clear_executions:1
msgid "Clears executions that were added with :meth:`.add_execution`."
msgstr "清除通过 :meth:`.add_execution` 添加的执行函数。"

#: 1dd27fa3473345f690c56b1c0bd8956c of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:1
msgid "Enables rotational hold-band logic and optional custom sizing."
msgstr "启用轮动持仓带逻辑，以及可选的自定义规模计算。"

#: 0a3de01a09a54092a2ca66ae26285700 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:3
msgid ""
"Each bar, held positions ranked worse than ``worst_rank_held`` are "
"liquidated, and the top-ranked symbols are entered to fill the position "
"slots that remain free. Without a ``sizer``, entries are equal-weighted "
"across :meth:`.set_max_long_positions` plus "
":meth:`.set_max_short_positions` slots."
msgstr ""
"每根 K 线，排名劣于 ``worst_rank_held`` 的持仓会被平仓，排名靠前的品种会入场以填补剩余的仓位名额。若未提供 "
"``sizer``，入场会在 :meth:`.set_max_long_positions` 加 "
":meth:`.set_max_short_positions` 的名额上等权重分配。"

#: 1d94cbf39b884afdade99f4681dcd485 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:9
msgid ""
"Rotation is exclusive: trading is driven entirely by "
":attr:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score` and "
":attr:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score`, and orders placed by an"
" :class:`.Execution` are ignored. Fill prices and stops set during an "
"execution are kept and applied to the orders rotation places."
msgstr ""
"轮动是排他性的：交易完全由 :attr:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score` 和 "
":attr:`pybroker.context.ExecContext.short_score` 驱动，:class:`.Execution` "
"下达的订单会被忽略。执行函数中设置的成交价格和止损会被保留，并应用于轮动所下达的订单。"

#: 3ef7eb6702e945daae2f426b6adc0e73 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:15
msgid ""
"Ranking spans the whole portfolio, so a held position without a rankable "
"score is liquidated even when another :class:`.Execution` opened it."
msgstr "排名覆盖整个投资组合，因此即使某个持仓是由另一个 :class:`.Execution` 开立的，只要它没有可排序的得分，也会被平仓。"

#: 8b55bee101694f1e87f2eeb6ba7de0e3 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:19
msgid ""
"Worst score rank at which a held position is kept, a searchable "
":class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`, or ``None`` to disable rotation. "
"Must be greater than or equal to the maximum long and short position "
"counts."
msgstr ""
"持仓被保留所允许的最差得分排名，可以是一个可搜索的 :class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`，或 "
"``None`` 以禁用轮动。必须大于或等于多头和空头仓位数量上限。"

#: e9c3973ada3f403aa741d18bb33fbffa of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation:23
msgid ""
"Optional :class:`Callable` that takes a "
":class:`pybroker.context.RotationContext` to override equal-weight entry "
"sizing after rotation decisions are made. Do not override sell or cover "
"signals set by rotation."
msgstr ""
"可选的 :class:`Callable`，接收一个 "
":class:`pybroker.context.RotationContext`，用于在轮动决策做出之后覆盖等权重的入场规模计算。不要覆盖轮动设置的卖出或回补信号。"

#: f92f11219061450a9ab320b75e2da64f of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_after_exec:1
msgid ""
"``Callable[[Mapping[str, ExecContext]], None]`` that runs after all "
"execution functions."
msgstr "在所有执行函数之后运行的 ``Callable[[Mapping[str, ExecContext]], None]``。"

#: 3f8b50a6d902471d98b0690767bc0537 dc5b8868ecbf4cf7b8f6371a9ec626a7 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_after_exec:4
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_before_exec:4
msgid ""
":class:`Callable` that takes a :class:`Mapping` of all ticker symbols to "
":class:`~pybroker.context.ExecContext`\\ s."
msgstr ""
"接收一个将所有股票代码映射到 :class:`~pybroker.context.ExecContext`\\ 的 "
":class:`Mapping` 的 :class:`Callable`。"

#: 5e135966981f416db91f2fe4e79c2685 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_before_exec:1
msgid ""
"``Callable[[Mapping[str, ExecContext]], None]`` that runs before all "
"execution functions."
msgstr "在所有执行函数之前运行的 ``Callable[[Mapping[str, ExecContext]], None]``。"

#: 50f3370ba36b4acf9c79991551e00ed7 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions:1
msgid "Sets the maximum number of long positions held at any time."
msgstr "设置任一时刻持有的最大多头仓位数量。"

#: a1faf00f16c04f359f2f092ccab78858 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_long_positions:3
msgid ""
"Maximum long positions, a searchable "
":class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`, or ``None`` for unlimited."
msgstr "最大多头仓位数量，可以是一个可搜索的 :class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`，或 ``None`` 表示不限。"

#: 0050db82391743a29dc3dc8ab094b9ee of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions:1
msgid "Sets the maximum number of short positions held at any time."
msgstr "设置任一时刻持有的最大空头仓位数量。"

#: 7844258007ae4505a4984f455ff250ac of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_max_short_positions:3
msgid ""
"Maximum short positions, a searchable "
":class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`, or ``None`` for unlimited."
msgstr "最大空头仓位数量，可以是一个可搜索的 :class:`pybroker.optimize.Hyperparam`，或 ``None`` 表示不限。"

#: 0f552b99033e4a84a45101dcb2843c4c of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_slippage_model:1
msgid "Sets :class:`pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel`."
msgstr "设置 :class:`pybroker.slippage.SlippageModel`。"

#: f083209a544448ed8e8b9364df5d58d0 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_slippage_model:3
msgid ""
"Built-in models are :class:`pybroker.slippage.FixedSlippageModel` (fixed "
"basis points), :class:`pybroker.slippage.VolatilitySlippageModel` (ATR-"
"scaled), and :class:`pybroker.slippage.VolumeSlippageModel` "
"(participation cap and square-law price impact). Pass ``None`` to disable"
" slippage."
msgstr ""
"内置模型包括 :class:`pybroker.slippage.FixedSlippageModel` "
"（固定基点）、:class:`pybroker.slippage.VolatilitySlippageModel` （基于 ATR 缩放）和 "
":class:`pybroker.slippage.VolumeSlippageModel` （参与度上限与平方律价格冲击）。传入 "
"``None`` 可禁用滑点。"

#: ed2e26229fa2496b978f7f929a262d48 of
#: pybroker.strategy.Strategy.set_slippage_model:9
msgid ""
"Fill-time slippage applies to scheduled orders, stop exits, and position "
"exits. Stop and position exits use the adjusted fill price only; share "
"adjustments are ignored on those paths because they exit an entry in "
"full."
msgstr "成交时滑点适用于已排定的订单、止损离场和头寸离场。止损和头寸离场仅使用调整后的成交价格；这些路径上的股数调整会被忽略，因为它们会全部平掉一笔入场。"

#: a38816fc17e24c8ca4249704f5e05f8e of pybroker.strategy.Strategy.walkforward:1
msgid ""
"Backtests the trading strategy using `Walkforward Analysis "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
"#Walkforward-Analysis>`_. Backtesting data supplied by the "
":class:`pybroker.data.DataSource` is divided into ``windows`` number of "
"equal sized time windows, with each window split into train and test data"
" as specified by ``train_size``. The backtest \"walks forward\" in time "
"through each window, running executions that were added with "
":meth:`.add_execution`."
msgstr ""
"使用 `向前分析（Walkforward Analysis） "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/notebooks/6.%20Training%20a%20Model.html"
